{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01365",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 6.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.65,
      "end_seconds": 11.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.93,
      "end_seconds": 20.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.78,
      "end_seconds": 25.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "please do. Extra information is always welcome"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 26.32,
      "end_seconds": 30.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "he's been having a cut on my finger doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 35.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.56,
      "end_seconds": 39.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "About two weeks give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.89,
      "end_seconds": 44.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer three weeks, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.99,
      "end_seconds": 51.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "okay, so roughly two to three weeks is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.38,
      "end_seconds": 55.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.76,
      "end_seconds": 61.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.95,
      "end_seconds": 69.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "it, It settles a little with pressure. I notice it more with gripping"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.53,
      "end_seconds": 73.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.51,
      "end_seconds": 81.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a numb fingertip as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.84,
      "end_seconds": 90.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "and the other thing I wanted to mention is that that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 90.2,
      "end_seconds": 95.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.6,
      "end_seconds": 101.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Let me think, I was getting to that! There's bleeding as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.09,
      "end_seconds": 103.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.39,
      "end_seconds": 115.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "as for numb fingertip, it's severe, honestly i'd say a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.99,
      "end_seconds": 123.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Right, did you get dirt in the wound, redness spreading, pus or bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.33,
      "end_seconds": 139.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.86,
      "text": "No, no dirt in the wound, no redness spreading, no pus. I did have difficulty bending the finger at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.37,
      "end_seconds": 142.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "And fever any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.42,
      "end_seconds": 145.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "not at all no fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 146.89,
      "end_seconds": 151.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Actually doctor I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.43,
      "end_seconds": 160.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "no I don't think I did maybe a a little I'm not sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.41,
      "end_seconds": 168.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "alright I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed what about weakness of the hand?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.52,
      "end_seconds": 172.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "no weakness of the hand, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.41,
      "end_seconds": 179.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.78,
      "end_seconds": 181.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.57,
      "end_seconds": 186.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.74,
      "end_seconds": 194.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.03,
      "end_seconds": 198.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "any regular medication tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.23,
      "end_seconds": 204.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Um no I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.45,
      "end_seconds": 209.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.82,
      "end_seconds": 213.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.73,
      "end_seconds": 229.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.49,
      "end_seconds": 232.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.24,
      "end_seconds": 243.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.07,
      "end_seconds": 247.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "I've had migraines yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.17,
      "end_seconds": 249.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.88,
      "end_seconds": 256.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "I have eczema"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.02,
      "end_seconds": 264.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Okay, I can see eczema in your file as well. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.99,
      "end_seconds": 271.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.53,
      "end_seconds": 275.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.83,
      "end_seconds": 281.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.75,
      "end_seconds": 285.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.42,
      "end_seconds": 301.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Okay this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.52,
      "end_seconds": 324.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 125 over 79 temp 37.0 degrees heart rate 79. And saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.94,
      "end_seconds": 326.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.04,
      "end_seconds": 330.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.65,
      "end_seconds": 335.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Okay time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.29,
      "end_seconds": 338.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.38,
      "end_seconds": 365.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "There is a two-centimetre clean cut over the first knuckle the finger moves fully and the fingertip feels normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.98,
      "end_seconds": 384.24,
      "duration_seconds": 14.26,
      "text": "that's the examination finished okay, thinking it through, my working impression is a clean finger laceration without nerve or tendon injury i can't rule out a tendon injury yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.57,
      "end_seconds": 387.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.35,
      "end_seconds": 419.92,
      "duration_seconds": 30.57,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a clean finger laceration without nerve or tendon injury, and we'll know more once the an X-ray of the finger is back. I'll request an X-ray of the finger, it'll help with laceration. Let's use tetanus booster, 0.5 ml, once, for one day. It's for tetanus prevention. Keep the dressing dry for two days and watch for redness or pus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.95,
      "end_seconds": 433.15,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Let's review you in five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.95,
      "end_seconds": 438.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "I can manage that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.69,
      "end_seconds": 442.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.28,
      "end_seconds": 447.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}